@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = paste-your-token-here

### List todos (first page)
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos

### Second page of 5
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos?page=2&pageSize=5

### Filter and sort
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos?isDone=false&search=milk&sort=-title

### Get one todo
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a todo
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the CRUD page"
}

### Update a todo
PUT {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write the CRUD page",
  "isDone": true
}

### Delete a todo (needs a token with the Admin role)
DELETE {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Break a validation rule
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

### Stats
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Queue a reminder email
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1/remind
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload an attachment
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1/attachment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebBoundary

--WebBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./notes.txt
--WebBoundary--

### Download it
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/todos/1/attachment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Projects
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/projects

### Project details
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/projects/1

### Create a project
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Home"
}

### Add a todo to a project
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/projects/1/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Plan the week"
}

### Who am I?
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
